                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16772747" author="artukhov" created="Wed, 20 Feb 2019 08:15:14 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Commit in branch &lt;b&gt;master&lt;/b&gt; which introduced the drop:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;[937164ea1a922ae32e54aa32b7356ef758599e87] IGNITE-10755: MVCC: Fix CQ registration in the middle of tx. This closes #5841.
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16772821" author="artukhov" created="Wed, 20 Feb 2019 09:42:15 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Drivers start-up parameters:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
-d 60 --client -j 10 -dn IgnitePutAllBenchmark -ds atomic-put-all-bs-100 -sm PRIMARY_SYNC -t 64 -bs 100 -w 60 -nn 12 -b 1
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16773808" author="ignitetcbot" created="Thu, 21 Feb 2019 08:25:01 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #F7D6C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All: Possible Blockers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#d04437&quot;&gt;MVCC Cache 6&lt;/font&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=3137655]&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;[tests 5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;IgniteCacheMvccTestSuite6: TxRollbackOnIncorrectParamsTest.testTimeoutSetRemoteGuarantee - 3,7% fails in last 216 master runs.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;IgniteCacheMvccTestSuite6: TxRollbackOnIncorrectParamsTest.testTimeoutSetLocalGuarantee - 3,7% fails in last 216 master runs.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;IgniteCacheMvccTestSuite6: TxRollbackOnIncorrectParamsTest.testRollbackInsideLocalListenerAfterRemoteFilter - 3,7% fails in last 216 master runs.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;IgniteCacheMvccTestSuite6: TxRollbackOnIncorrectParamsTest.testLabelFilledLocalGuarantee - 3,7% fails in last 216 master runs.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;IgniteCacheMvccTestSuite6: TxRollbackOnIncorrectParamsTest.testLabelFilledRemoteGuarantee - 3,7% fails in last 216 master runs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=3134718&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity &lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All&lt;/b&gt; Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16773815" author="rkondakov" created="Thu, 21 Feb 2019 08:28:53 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=gvvinblade&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;gvvinblade&quot;&gt;gvvinblade&lt;/a&gt;, please review the patch. Performance drop looks fixed. TC run is OK. Problem with the listed blockers also &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewType.html?buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_MvccCache6&amp;amp;tab=buildTypeHistoryList&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=%3Cdefault%3E&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;exists in the master branch&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The solution was to replace CQ listeners guard lock from &lt;tt&gt;ReentrantReadWriteLock&lt;/tt&gt; to &lt;tt&gt;StripedCompositeReadWriteLock&lt;/tt&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16774365" author="gvvinblade" created="Thu, 21 Feb 2019 18:08:23 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=rkondakov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;rkondakov&quot;&gt;rkondakov&lt;/a&gt;, no objections from me, should work. Merged to master.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                    </comments>
